  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "{\"original_inventory_ordinal\":689,\"taxon\":\"Genyornis newtoni\",\"classification\":\"Dromornithidae, Galloanserae; exact placement debated, not a living goose species\",\"representation\":\"living-reconstruction\",\"reconstruction_type\":\"whole-organism\",\"scope\":\"Complete robust flightless bird with tall goose-shaped bill and low cranial-rostral casque. Subsequent pool not frozen72.\",\"scale\":{\"unit\":\"meter\",\"standing_height_model_m\":2.0,\"height_status\":\"Approximate upright reconstruction informed by Flinders VAMP over2m summary; NOT exact articulated specimen measurement. Neck posture variable.\",\"SAMA_P59521_rostrum_length_m\":0.2124,\"SAMA_P59521_rostrum_height_m\":0.0729,\"SAMA_P59521_rostrum_width_m\":0.07605,\"SAMA_P59521_casque_length_m\":0.0514,\"SAMA_P59521_casque_width_m\":0.0763,\"SAMA_P59516_skull_length_min_m\":0.296,\"measurement_note\":\"2024 Appendix2 TableA1. P59516 total296mm is minimum because displaced rostrum overlaps cranium. P59521 is separate specimen. Do NOT merge into false single exact specimen.\"},\"diagnostic_targets\":[\"Broad robust feathered body, heavy walking legs and thick neck; no gracile ostrich body.\",\"Tall but comparatively broad rounded goose-like upper bill, not a raptor hook or huge deep Dromornis block.\",\"Low broad triangular casque across dorsal bill base, not a tall cassowary horn or Sylviornis exaggerated knob.\",\"Two small reduced folded wings present, unlike completely wingless moa.\",\"Three forward digits with blunt hoof-like claws, no recurved raptorial talons, no swimming webbing implied from goose nickname.\",\"Conservative muted feather/skin palette, bare head-neck coverage and colors treated as inferred.\"],\"uncertainties\":[\"2024 cranial reconstruction combines fossils with deformation corrections; do not copy fossil crushing or cracked edges into live anatomy.\",\"Soft contour, skin coverage, plumage and colors not preserved, author art is interpretation.\",\"Overall2m body height is an estimate; original limb specimen dimensions not measured here.\",\"Exact relationship within Galloanserae unresolved; giant-goose popular shorthand not taxonomic identification as Anatidae.\"]}",
    "zh": "原创低多边形研究；形态、尺度及不确定性严格以本次已核参考为界。原始限定：{\"original_inventory_ordinal\":689,\"taxon\":\"Genyornis newtoni\",\"classification\":\"Dromornithidae, Galloanserae; exact placement debated, not a living goose species\",\"representation\":\"living-reconstruction\",\"reconstruction_type\":\"whole-organism\",\"scope\":\"Complete robust flightless bird with tall goose-shaped bill and low cranial-rostral casque. Subsequent pool not frozen72.\",\"scale\":{\"unit\":\"meter\",\"standing_height_model_m\":2.0,\"height_status\":\"Approximate upright reconstruction informed by Flinders VAMP over2m summary; NOT exact articulated specimen measurement. Neck posture variable.\",\"SAMA_P59521_rostrum_length_m\":0.2124,\"SAMA_P59521_rostrum_height_m\":0.0729,\"SAMA_P59521_rostrum_width_m\":0.07605,\"SAMA_P59521_casque_length_m\":0.0514,\"SAMA_P59521_casque_width_m\":0.0763,\"SAMA_P59516_skull_length_min_m\":0.296,\"measurement_note\":\"2024 Appendix2 TableA1. P59516 total296mm is minimum because displaced rostrum overlaps cranium. P59521 is separate specimen. Do NOT merge into false single exact specimen.\"},\"diagnostic_targets\":[\"Broad robust feathered body, heavy walking legs and thick neck; no gracile ostrich body.\",\"Tall but comparatively broad rounded goose-like upper bill, not a raptor hook or huge deep Dromornis block.\",\"Low broad triangular casque across dorsal bill base, not a tall cassowary horn or Sylviornis exaggerated knob.\",\"Two small reduced folded wings present, unlike completely wingless moa.\",\"Three forward digits with blunt hoof-like claws, no recurved raptorial talons, no swimming webbing implied from goose nickname.\",\"Conservative muted feather/skin palette, bare head-neck coverage and colors treated as inferred.\"],\"uncertainties\":[\"2024 cranial reconstruction combines fossils with deformation corrections; do not copy fossil crushing or cracked edges into live anatomy.\",\"Soft contour, skin coverage, plumage and colors not preserved, author art is interpretation.\",\"Overall2m body height is an estimate; original limb specimen dimensions not measured here.\",\"Exact relationship within Galloanserae unresolved; giant-goose popular shorthand not taxonomic identification as Anatidae.\"]}"
  },
